@startuml pipeline
' the ECSS pipeline of uuid7 (ecss/README.md); hand-written
title The ECSS pipeline of uuid7
skinparam shadowing false
start
:requirement, component, case, review
in the rms (kyr-rms-cli),
seeded from ecss/**/*.csv;
:code with @ingroup and @satisfies,
tests with @verifies;
partition "ecss/make.sh (one click)" {
  :utils/deps.sh sysroot;
  :utils/run_pipeline.sh
  gates, six profiles, the suites,
  the scenarios (one .puml each),
  coverage, stress, packages;
  :evidence: packages rebuilt (reproducibility),
  hardening, nm and readelf analyses;
  :ecss/tools/ecss.py
  model = rms export, else the CSVs,
  + the tags + the results;
  :class, package, component diagrams;
  :PlantUML to SVG (when java is installed);
  :Markdown documents (build/ecss/md);
  :doxygen site (build/ecss/html);
}
:build/ecss/rms/load.sh
artifacts, links, results into the rms;
:review the package;
note right: RIDs are rms review-comments
:kyr-rms-cli baseline <REVIEW>;
:build/ecss/rms/export.sh
package export into ecss/rms_export/;
note right: committed; the next make.sh reads it
stop
@enduml
